On Fri, Dec 06, 2002 at 01:06:54PM +1030, Wilkinson,Alex wrote:

> What is the diff between:
> 
> *5.0-DP2-disc2.iso
> *5.0-DP2-mini.iso
> *5.0-DP1-install.iso ( is there going to be a 5.0-DP2-install.iso )

It is explained in the README in the same ftp directory.
disc2 is a live filesystem, mini is a mini installation disk
(not including any packages, that is).
install is a full-blown installation CD of a DP1, including
various pre-built packages (XFree, for example).
And the question about DP2-install.iso should be posed to jhb ;)

