Hi all!

I'm trying to update the net/mldonkey port. Unfortunately, no matter
what I do, I constantly get segmentation fault with the GTK GUI.
Self-compiled, the OSF1 version, Linux version; static, shared.

Maybe my EV4 is the problem. Do you want to try out my attached port
on other machines?
It is split into core and GUI. Feel free do download the other versions
from the mldonkey web site (http://www.freesoftware.fsf.org/mldonkey/)
and try them as well.

Thank you,
Holger

--=20
"Computer games don't affect kids. If Pacman would have affected us as
children, we would now run around in darkened rooms, munching pills and
listening to repetetive music."

