else, whether host name or IP address, errors immediately with "The
connection was refused when attempting to contact {...}".  Going to the
same sites with OSF1-Netscape and native Konquerer from the same host
works fine.

I think I must have botched my linux_base hook into the native TCP/IP,
but I cannot see where or how?  tcpdump shows the name resolution is
working and some communication with the site occurs.

Anyone have advice in troubleshooting this?  Or am I stuck downgrading
my linux-mozilla?

